msgid "# Layerwise KV Pool Configuration Contract"
msgstr "# 逐层 KV 池配置契约"

msgid ""
"`AscendStoreConnector` saves and loads external KV one layer at a time. This\n"
"page is the common configuration reference for\n"
"[Ascend Store](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md),\n"
"[Mooncake layerwise pooling](mooncake_layerwise_adaptation_and_optimization.md),\n"
"and [shared-buffer offloading](layerwise_and_sparse_kv_cache_offloading.md).\n"
"The latter combines a Store connector with a separate P/D connector and has\n"
"additional deployment requirements."
msgstr ""
"`AscendStoreConnector` 按层保存和加载外部 KV。本页是[Ascend Store](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)、[Mooncake "
"逐层池化](mooncake_layerwise_adaptation_and_optimization.md)和[共享缓冲区卸载](layerwise_and_sparse_kv_cache_offloading.md)的公共配置参考。共享缓冲区卸载将"
" Store 连接器与独立的 P/D 连接器组合使用，另有部署要求。"

msgid "## Support Matrix {#support-matrix}"
msgstr "## 支持矩阵 {#support-matrix}"

msgid ""
"This matrix describes the paths in current `main`. “Supported” means the\n"
"listed implementation and configuration are available; hardware validation\n"
"must cover the actual model, backend and parallel topology before deployment.\n"
"An attention hook or CPU configuration test alone is insufficient hardware\n"
"evidence. The PR introducing this reference records its validation scope and\n"
"requests maintainer confirmation of the release matrix."
msgstr ""
"本矩阵描述当前 `main` 的代码路径。“支持”表示已有相应实现和配置；部署前仍须在真实硬件上验证所用模型、后端和并行拓扑。仅有 attention hook 或 CPU "
"配置测试不能作为硬件证据。本参考文档所属 PR 记录实际验证范围，并请求维护者确认发布支持矩阵。"

msgid ""
"| Configuration | Memcache / GVA | Mooncake / block-key | Yuanrong / key-based |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `kv_producer` | Supported | Supported | Unsupported |\n"
"| `kv_consumer` | Supported; explicitly enable pool reads/writes | Supported; explicitly enable "
"pool reads/writes | Unsupported |\n"
"| `kv_both` | Supported | Supported | Unsupported |\n"
"| `attention_v1`, `mla_v1`, `sfa_v1`, `dsa_v1` with compatible cache layouts | Supported | "
"Supported | Unsupported |\n"
"| `attention_cp`, `mla_cp`, `sfa_cp`, `dsa_cp` with the topology constraints below | Supported | "
"Supported | Unsupported |\n"
"| Single cache group | Supported | Supported | Unsupported |\n"
"| Multiple attention cache groups | Supported; groups retain their own layouts | Supported | "
"Unsupported |\n"
"| MTP cache layers | Supported; included in physical-layer addressing | Supported; included in "
"stage-local objects | Unsupported |\n"
"| Sparse/indexer attention cache | Supported; preserve component layouts | Supported; preserve "
"component layouts | Unsupported |\n"
"| Non-`AttentionSpec` state with cross-layer buffer reuse | Unsupported | Unsupported; no NPU "
"buffer reuse | Unsupported |\n"
"| Aligned recurrent state without buffer reuse | Supported subject to the model's cacheability "
"policy | Supported; see the hybrid guide | Unsupported |\n"
"| Cross-layer NPU buffer reuse | Supported for compatible attention specs | Unsupported | "
"Unsupported |\n"
"| Matching TP | Supported | Supported | Unsupported |\n"
"| Producer/consumer TP mismatch | Unsupported | Unsupported | Unsupported |\n"
"| PCP | Supported with matching producer/consumer shard layout | Supported with matching "
"topology; no KVPP combination | Unsupported |\n"
"| DCP greater than one | Supported with matching producer/consumer shard layout | Unsupported | "
"Unsupported |\n"
"| PP | Supported with global layer addressing | Supported with matching partition; no empty "
"stage-local groups | Unsupported |"
msgstr ""
"| 配置 | Memcache / GVA | Mooncake / block-key | Yuanrong / key-based |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `kv_producer` | 支持 | 支持 | 不支持 |\n"
"| `kv_consumer` | 支持；须显式开启池读写 | 支持；须显式开启池读写 | 不支持 |\n"
"| `kv_both` | 支持 | 支持 | 不支持 |\n"
"| `attention_v1`, `mla_v1`, `sfa_v1`, `dsa_v1` （缓存布局须兼容） | 支持 | 支持 | 不支持 |\n"
"| `attention_cp`, `mla_cp`, `sfa_cp`, `dsa_cp` （须遵守下方拓扑约束） | 支持 | 支持 | 不支持 |\n"
"| 单缓存组 | 支持 | 支持 | 不支持 |\n"
"| 多个 attention 缓存组 | 支持；各组保留自身布局 | 支持 | 不支持 |\n"
"| MTP 缓存层 | 支持；计入物理层寻址 | 支持；计入本 stage 对象 | 不支持 |\n"
"| 稀疏/indexer attention 缓存 | 支持；保留各分量布局 | 支持；保留各分量布局 | 不支持 |\n"
"| 非 `AttentionSpec` 状态与跨层缓冲区复用组合 | 不支持 | 不支持；不复用 NPU 缓冲区 | 不支持 |\n"
"| 不复用缓冲区且对齐的循环状态 | 支持；遵循模型的缓存策略 | 支持；见混合模型指南 | 不支持 |\n"
"| 跨层 NPU 缓冲区复用 | 支持兼容的 attention spec | 不支持 | 不支持 |\n"
"| TP 一致 | 支持 | 支持 | 不支持 |\n"
"| 生产者/消费者 TP 不一致 | 不支持 | 不支持 | 不支持 |\n"
"| PCP | 支持；生产者和消费者分片布局须一致 | 支持；拓扑须一致，不能与 KVPP 组合 | 不支持 |\n"
"| DCP 大于 1 | 支持；生产者和消费者分片布局须一致 | 不支持 | 不支持 |\n"
"| PP | 支持；使用全局层寻址 | 支持；层划分须一致，stage 内组不能为空 | 不支持 |"

msgid ""
"Attention integration includes `attention_v1`, `mla_v1`, `sfa_v1`, and\n"
"`dsa_v1`, together with the corresponding `attention_cp`, `mla_cp`, `sfa_cp`,\n"
"and DSA CP implementations. Their presence does not override backend, cache\n"
"layout, or parallelism restrictions in the matrix. Use the model's deployment\n"
"guide for graph mode, quantization and hardware requirements."
msgstr ""
"Attention 集成包括 `attention_v1`、`mla_v1`、`sfa_v1`、`dsa_v1`，以及对应的 `attention_cp`、`mla_cp`、`sfa_cp` 和"
" DSA CP 实现。代码集成不代表可以忽略矩阵中的后端、缓存布局或并行约束。图模式、量化和硬件要求请参阅具体模型的部署指南。"

msgid ""
"All sharing instances must agree on weights, cache format, block sizes,\n"
"transfer mode and namespace. Mooncake readers and writers additionally require\n"
"matching TP/PP/PCP topology and PP layer partitions. For hybrid cache-state\n"
"constraints, see [Mooncake hybrid attention](mooncake_hybrid_attention.md)."
msgstr ""
"共享实例必须使用一致的模型权重、缓存格式、块大小、传输模式和命名空间。Mooncake 读写实例还必须使用相同的 TP/PP/PCP 拓扑及 PP 层划分。混合缓存状态的约束见[Mooncake"
" 混合 attention](mooncake_hybrid_attention.md)。"

msgid ""
"Yuanrong and unknown layerwise backends fail during Connector, Scheduler or\n"
"Worker initialization with the backend and conflicting data plane in the\n"
"error. Mooncake rejects GVA-only buffer options instead of ignoring them.\n"
"Existing guards reject TP mismatch, Mooncake DCP, empty PP groups, and\n"
"unsupported reuse layouts before transfer threads begin."
msgstr ""
"Yuanrong 及未知的逐层后端在 Connector、Scheduler 或 Worker 初始化期间报错，错误包含后端和冲突的数据平面。Mooncake 会拒绝 GVA "
"专用的缓冲区选项，不再静默忽略。现有检查会在传输线程启动前拒绝 TP 不匹配、Mooncake DCP、空 PP 缓存组和不兼容的复用布局。"

msgid "## Parameters and Defaults {#parameters-and-defaults}"
msgstr "## 参数与默认值 {#parameters-and-defaults}"

msgid ""
"Set these options in `kv_transfer_config.kv_connector_extra_config`, including\n"
"inside the Store child of `MultiConnector`. They are not `--additional-config`\n"
"options."
msgstr ""
"在 `kv_transfer_config.kv_connector_extra_config` 中设置这些选项；使用 `MultiConnector` 时放入 Store "
"子连接器配置。它们不属于 `--additional-config` 选项。"

msgid ""
"| Parameter | Default | Contract |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `use_layerwise` | `false` | Enable per-layer save/load for a supported backend. |\n"
"| `layerwise_prefetch_layers` with Memcache/GVA | `min(layerwise_num_shared_buffers, 8)` | "
"Positive integer prefetch distance. The omitted buffer budget resolves to the number of cache-"
"bearing layers. |\n"
"| `layerwise_prefetch_layers` with Mooncake/block-key | `2` | Preserve the current `main` "
"default. Set `1` explicitly for the historical key-based default. |\n"
"| `discard_partial_chunks` | `true` | Identical default in ordinary and layerwise pooling; "
"explicit supported overrides are retained. |\n"
"| `layerwise_num_shared_buffers` | Cache-bearing layer count | GVA only. A smaller budget enables"
" compatible cross-layer reuse. Independent layers keep separate buffers. |\n"
"| `layerwise_independent_layers` | `[0]` | GVA only. Dedicated layers; `\"all\"` disables cross-"
"layer reuse. |"
msgstr ""
"| 参数 | 默认值 | 契约 |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `use_layerwise` | `false` | 为支持的后端开启逐层保存/加载。 |\n"
"| `layerwise_prefetch_layers` （Memcache/GVA） | `min(layerwise_num_shared_buffers, 8)` | "
"正整数预取距离。未配置缓冲区预算时，使用含缓存的层数。 |\n"
"| `layerwise_prefetch_layers` （Mooncake/block-key） | `2` | 保留当前 `main` 默认值。可显式设置 `1` 以采用历史 key-"
"based 默认值。 |\n"
"| `discard_partial_chunks` | `true` | 普通池化和逐层池化默认值相同；保留受支持的显式覆盖。 |\n"
"| `layerwise_num_shared_buffers` | 含缓存的层数 | 仅限 GVA。较小预算可启用兼容的跨层复用。独立层保留单独缓冲区。 |\n"
"| `layerwise_independent_layers` | `[0]` | 仅限 GVA。指定专用层；`\"all\"` 禁用跨层复用。 |"

msgid ""
"Every reachable layerwise path uses the same prefetch parser. It accepts a\n"
"positive Python/JSON integer or a losslessly parsed decimal integer string,\n"
"such as `\"3\"`, `\"003\"`, or `\"+3\"`; surrounding whitespace is stripped.\n"
"Booleans, floats (including `2.0`), null, empty/non-decimal strings, zero and\n"
"negative values raise `ValueError` naming `layerwise_prefetch_layers` before a\n"
"backend client or transfer thread is created. Explicit null is an invalid\n"
"value, rather than an omitted setting. There is no additional upper clamp on\n"
"an explicit positive prefetch distance."
msgstr ""
"所有可进入的逐层路径使用同一预取解析器。它接受正的 Python/JSON 整数，或可无损解析为正整数的十进制字符串，例如 "
"`\"3\"`、`\"003\"`、`\"+3\"`；字符串首尾空白会被去除。布尔值、浮点数（包括 `2.0`）、null、空字符串、非十进制字符串、零和负数均会在后端客户端或传输线程创建前触发"
" `ValueError`，错误包含 `layerwise_prefetch_layers`。显式 null 是非法值，不等同于未配置。显式正整数预取距离没有额外的上限截断。"

msgid ""
"A consumer enables pool loads with `consumer_is_to_load=true` and pool writes\n"
"with `consumer_is_to_put=true`. Setting `use_layerwise=true` alone does not\n"
"enable these operations. Decode-only `save_decode_cache=true` without\n"
"`consumer_is_to_put=true` remains incompatible with layerwise transfer."
msgstr ""
"Consumer 通过 `consumer_is_to_load=true` 开启池读取，通过 `consumer_is_to_put=true` 开启池写入。仅设置 "
"`use_layerwise=true` 不会开启这些操作。仅 Decode 写入的 `save_decode_cache=true` 配置若未设置 "
"`consumer_is_to_put=true`，仍与逐层传输不兼容。"

msgid "## Compatibility and Resources"
msgstr "## 兼容性与资源"

msgid ""
"The historical task specification used a key-based prefetch default of `1`.\n"
"Current `main` uses `2` for Mooncake block-key transfer; this change retains\n"
"that value. GVA defaults, explicit valid overrides and\n"
"`discard_partial_chunks=true` are unchanged. Invalid values previously accepted\n"
"by `int()` (particularly floats and booleans), unsupported backends, and\n"
"silently ignored GVA-only options now fail at initialization."
msgstr ""
"历史任务书中的 key-based 预取默认值为 `1`。当前 `main` 的 Mooncake block-key 默认值为 `2`，本次修改保留该值。GVA 默认值、合法的显式覆盖及 "
"`discard_partial_chunks=true` 均保持不变。过去被 `int()` 接受的非法值（特别是浮点数和布尔值）、不支持的后端以及过去被静默忽略的 GVA "
"专用选项，现在会在初始化时报错。"

msgid ""
"Prefetch controls when loads are submitted. It does not by itself allocate\n"
"extra NPU KV cache buffers; buffer counts follow cache planning and GVA reuse\n"
"settings. A wider window can change in-flight transfer metadata, read sessions,\n"
"leases and backend resources. Measure actual peak device/host memory and\n"
"latency/throughput with the selected backend and workload before tuning it.\n"
"No new memory or performance guarantee follows from the prefetch value."
msgstr ""
"预取控制加载请求的提交时机，本身不会额外分配 NPU KV 缓存缓冲区；缓冲区数量由缓存规划和 GVA 复用配置决定。扩大窗口可能改变在途传输元数据、读取会话、lease "
"及后端资源占用。调优前应使用目标后端和负载测量实际设备/主机峰值内存、延迟和吞吐量。预取值不带来额外的内存或性能保证。"

msgid "## Validation"
msgstr "## 验证"

msgid ""
"`tests/ut/distributed/ascend_store/test_layerwise_config.py` covers role and\n"
"default contracts, both parser paths, explicit overrides, unsupported backends,\n"
"GVA-only options and rejection before client/thread creation. Existing pool,\n"
"hybrid, PCP, pipeline and cache-layout tests cover the corresponding paths.\n"
"Representative hardware evidence must identify NPU model/card count, software\n"
"versions, TP/CP/PP topology, backend, model and command, and distinguish actual\n"
"backend/model execution from mocked tests run on an NPU host."
msgstr ""
"`tests/ut/distributed/ascend_store/test_layerwise_config.py` 覆盖角色和默认值契约、两条解析路径、显式覆盖、不支持的后端、GVA "
"专用选项，以及创建客户端/线程前的拒绝行为。现有池化、混合模型、PCP、流水线和缓存布局测试覆盖对应路径。代表性硬件证据须注明 NPU 型号与卡数、软件版本、TP/CP/PP "
"拓扑、后端、模型和命令，并区分真实后端/模型执行与仅在 NPU 主机运行的 mock 测试。"
